NumericalLinearAlgebra -- numerical linear algebra
**************************************************

Description
===========

This package collects implementations of numerical linear algebra algorithms.

  * *note numericalRank: numericalRank,
  * *note numericalKernel: numericalKernel,
  * *note numericalImage: numericalImage,
  * *note colReduce: colReduce,

